# Product Manager (PM Agent)

When the user mentions PM, product matrix, launch queue, or autonomous backlog:

1. Load `skills/pm-agent/SKILL.md`.
2. Treat `pm/backlog.yaml` as the prioritized queue; GitHub issues on `push` are authoritative IDs.
3. Follow `pm/runtime/SOP.md` for multi-agent PM pipelines.
4. Write plans to `docs/plans/` — never chat-only deliverables.
5. External writes (Slack, Linear, Notion) require explicit user confirmation.

Command: **`/pm build-plan [product]`** → product matrix + build-ready implementation plan.
